{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combatants｜结构图\n外置 ASC 宿主的最小共同契约。[[Combatants/结构|结构文档]] · 玩家 [[Teams/结构]] · Boss [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1530,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCombatantState\n`GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent()` → 持久 ASC。\n`AttachAvatar(NewPawn)` → 同步引用、PawnExtension 与 ActorInfo。\n`DetachAvatar(ExpectedPawn)` → 只清当前 Avatar。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "attr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ASC + HealthSet + CombatSet\n宿主默认子对象；Owner 生命周期跨 Pawn。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 当前 APawn / PawnExtension\n作为可替换 Avatar；客户端 `OnRep_AvatarPawn()` 后重新绑定。[[Character/结构]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterSlot\n继承宿主；加玩家 Owner、Mixed 复制、PawnData/编队语义。[[Teams/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "boss",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOBossState\n继承宿主；加 Definition、Form/Phase 标签和 Boss 能力。[[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 共同宿主最小接口\nGetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent() → 向 GA/BT/PawnExtension 暴露持久 ASC；不暴露玩家专属 Slot API。\nAttachAvatar(NewPawn) → SynchronizeAvatarBinding → PawnExtension::InitializeAbilitySystem(ASC, Owner)；OnRep_AvatarPawn 在客户端重放绑定。\nDetachAvatar(ExpectedPawn) 只解绑期望 Pawn，防旧形态延迟销毁时清掉新 Avatar。Player Slot 与 BossState 只复用这一宿主契约，不复用输入或决策策略。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
